{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09282","headline":"冬夜 · 韦应物","name":"冬夜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杳杳日云夕，郁结谁爲开。\n单衾自不暖，霜霰已皑皑。\n晚岁沦夙志，惊鸿感深哀。\n深哀当何爲，桃李忽凋摧。\n帏怅徒自设，冥寞岂复来。\n平生虽恩重，迁去托穷埃。\n抱此女曹恨，顾非高世才。\n振衣中夜起，河汉尚裴回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09282.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09282","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}